'' ONE OVERLOAD'S WORD IS NOT ITS SIBLINGS': a 'private operator =' on U beside a 'public
'' operator =' on T, and a private Show( string ) beside a Show( long ) made public by its
'' 'public declare'. The words were put on the NAME, so the private one made every overload
'' internal; the public ones nothing in the module called were not emitted, and the
'' importer's link failed on them -- sys/win/com's CInt96 '=' beside DVARIANT's private one.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/ovvis/libs tests/modules/src/ovvis/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/ovvislink.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/ovvislink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/ovvislink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: T equal
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: T differ
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: long 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: string inside
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: string inside
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: true false
